# Interpreters -- BOTH of them. .venv is the torch-free one the suite runs on;
# .venv-speaker carries torch (~850 MB). Listing only .venv shipped that second
# one into the build context on any direct `docker build`. It went unnoticed
# because `gcloud builds submit` falls back to .gitignore, which does cover it.
.venv
.venv-speaker
tests
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.env
client_secret*.json
